UID:9242250d555141f811327bf1381f49db@wheeling-events
DTSTAMP:20260727T132255Z
SUMMARY:Red\, White & Zoo
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260731
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260801
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate America 250 at the Oglebay Good Zoo with a month of
  patriotic\, family-friendly activities every Friday in July. Learn about
  native wildlife\, meet animal ambassadors\, enjoy hands-on crafts and ga
 mes\, and discover how enrichment supports animal care\, wellness\, and p
 lay. Friday\, July 3 | 12 - 2 PM Patriotic Animal Enrichment & Bald Eagle
  Keeper Talk Create red\, white\, and blue enrichment items for the anima
 ls to enjoy while learning how enrichment supports animal care and play. 
 Then\, join a special Bald Eagle keeper talk at 2 PM. Friday\, July 10 | 
 12 - 2 PM Eagle Craft Workshop Kids can create a bald eagle-themed craft 
 to take home while learning more about one of America’s most iconic nat
 ive species. Friday\, July 17 | 12 - 2 PM Native Speicies Discovery Day L
 earn about native wildlife including the bobcat\, eastern hellbender\, ba
 ld eagle\, and red wolf through interactive games and activities. Guests 
 can take home themed coloring sheets filled with fun animal facts — or 
 color them on-site at our activity table. Friday\, July 24 | 10 AM - 5 PM
  Patriotic Zoo Scavenger Hunt Pick up a scavenger hunt at the zoo entranc
 e and explore the Good Zoo to complete the challenge. Turn in your comple
 ted hunt to receive a sweet prize. Friday\, July 31 | 12 - 1 PM Native Re
 ptile Meet & Greet Meet one of the zoo’s ambassador reptiles native to 
 the United States and learn about common reptiles found in our region\, i
 ncluding what to do if you encounter one in the wild. All activities will
  take place outside the Conservation Center unless otherwise noted. In th
 e event of rain\, activities will move to the Red Wolf viewing area. Expl
 ore Zoo Experiences\nSchedule note: Every Friday\nCategories: Agricultura
 l\, Educational\, Family Fun\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com/events/red-
 white-zoo/
LOCATION:Oglebay Good Zoo\, 465 Lodge Drive\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/red-white-zoo/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
