DTSTAMP:20260727T132255Z
SUMMARY:"Guys and Dolls"
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260810
DESCRIPTION:Parcel Players presents the Tony Award Winning Guys and Dolls
  on August 6th-9th at Towngate Theatre. Guys and Dolls\, with a book by A
 be Burrow and Jo Swerling\, musica and lyrics by Frank Loesser\, is a cla
 ssic musical comedy set in mythical New York City\, based on Damon Runyon
 ’s stories about gamblers and “mission dolls”. It premiered on Broa
 dway in 1950\, winning the Tony Award for Best Musical\, and features ico
 nic characters like Sky Masterson\, Sarah Brown\, Nathan Detroit\, and Mi
 ss Adelaide\, alongside famous songs like “Luck be a Lady” and “Sit
  Down\, You’re Rockin’ the Boat”. The show is celebrated for its hu
 mor\, memorable score\, and enduring popularity\, leading to numerous rev
 ivals and a famous 1955 film adaptation. Directed by Erin Bond Tickets ar
 e $17.50 and showtimes August 6-8 are at 7pm with a 3pm matinee on Sunday
 \, August 9. GET TICKETS HERE or call 304-242-7700\nCategories: Family Fu
 n\, Music\, Theater\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com/events/guys-and-doll
 s/
LOCATION:Oglebay Institute's Towngate Theatre & Cinema\, 2118 Market Stre
 et\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/guys-and-dolls/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
