DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260821T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260821T213000
DESCRIPTION:Don’t Miss Wheeling’s Favorite Summer Party for the Arts!
  Board Benefit 2026 | Friday\, August 21 | 6:30-9:30 PM | The Mansion Mus
 eum\, Oglebay. Some evenings are just different. The Board Benefit is one
  of them. Oglebay Institute’s Board of Trustees invites friends and sup
 porters of Wheeling’s leading arts & cultural organization to gather fo
 r this lavish party. Attendees will enjoy gourmet food\, desserts\, beer 
 garden\, live music and an open bar in the elegant Mansion Museum and on 
 its picturesque lawn. Funds raised engage tens of thousands of Ohio Valle
 y residents and visitors in arts\, nature\, and history experiences throu
 gh OI all year long. This year’s gourmet buffets will be catered by Che
 f Adam/Chef N Company with an elegant grazing table by Table 304. Smooth 
 Jazz music will be provided by saxophonist Calvin Stemley\, and a 360 vid
 eo booth by Lit Photography. Board Benefit 2026 is presented by Spilman\,
  Thomas & Battle\, PLLC\, with additional support from WVU Medicine Wheel
 ing Hospital\, Inc.\, and Truist. Tickets are $110 per person in advance 
 and $120 at the door. Add an Oglebay Institute Board Benefit commemorativ
 e wine glass to your ticket for $20. PURCHASE TICKETS ONLINE\, from any b
 oard member\, or call 304-242-4200. Can’t attend but still wish to supp
 ort the arts\, history\, and nature in Wheeling? Click HERE to donate.\nS
 chedule note: One Day Only\nCategories: Fundraiser\, Outdoors\nSource: ht
 tps://wheelingcvb.com/events/oglebay-institutes-board-benefit/
LOCATION:Oglebay Institute's Mansion Museum\, 465 Lodge Drive\, Wheeling\
 , WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/oglebay-institutes-board-benefit/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
