BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1a58407ef8a65ed6be5c9f7d9f8b9194@wheeling-events
DTSTAMP:20260727T132255Z
SUMMARY:Pepsi Summer Concert Series: Bucket of Puppies
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260904T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260904T223000
DESCRIPTION:The Pepsi Summer Concert Series is returning to the WesBanco 
 Arena Patio this summer — and this year it’s presented by Gumby’s! 
 Join us for four nights of live music\, cold drinks\, food favorites\, an
 d patio vibes in downtown Wheeling. WesBanco Arena Patio 6PM–10:30PM FR
 EE Admission September 4 — Bucket of Puppies Last year Bucket Of Puppie
 s blew the roof off of our inaugural Party On The Patio series - this yea
 r\, they’re closing us out on September 4th! BoP will perform a blend o
 f originals and covers that will have you dancing\, grooving\, hooping\, 
 and getting lost to the floaty jams that envelop like a warm hug. Commonl
 y described as an Appalachian Jam Band\, Bucket of Puppies has earned a r
 eputation for their unforgettable live shows and devoted fan base. Every 
 show feels like a family/friend reunion! Their ability to blend structure
 d compositions with extended improvisations create an atmosphere of unbri
 dled energy\, freedom\, and joy\, creating a conversation between the ban
 d and their audience\, all of which adds to the collective groove. Not ju
 st a band\; it's an experience of joy\, connection\, camaraderie\, and th
 e limitless power of music.Returning all season long: Big Timber Brewing 
 Tap Takeover Nail City Records Pop-Up Shop So Nuts 4 Donuts NEW THIS YEAR
  — VINYL JAM Hosted by Nail City Records from 6PM–7:30PM before each 
 band\, Vinyl Jam will feature a hand-picked collection of records curated
  specially for that evening’s lineup. Also new this summer: Kona Brewin
 g BIG BITES Food Tent Island-inspired flavors meet refreshing craft beer 
 with a menu featuring teriyaki lo mein\, crispy pot stickers\, BBQ pulled
  pork sandwiches\, and more bold Pacific-style bites. Whether you’re co
 ming for the music\, the food\, the beer\, or the atmosphere — the pati
 o is the place to be this summer.\nSchedule note: One Day Only\nCategorie
 s: Free Events\, Music\, Outdoors\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com/events
 /pepsi-summer-concert-series-bucket-of-puppies/
LOCATION:WesBanco Arena Patio\, 2 14th Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/pepsi-summer-concert-series-bucket-of-
 puppies/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
