BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1396e509ddb3ebdb5b94e5d8bead2a21@wheeling-events
DTSTAMP:20260727T132255Z
SUMMARY:CAIN: Live and In Worship w/ Lizzie Morgan
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261001T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261001T210000
DESCRIPTION:Pouring their joy into their music\, CAIN has discovered what
  it’s like to live their calling while doing their favorite thing - sin
 ging about Jesus. Raised in Hartselle\, Alabama as pastor's kids\, CAIN -
  Taylor Cain Matz\, Madison Cain Johnson\, and Logan Cain - got their fir
 st break opening for Dave Barnes and Andrew Ripp at a show in 2012. Now m
 ore than a decade later\, they've headlined multiple tours and shared the
  stage with Chris Tomlin\, TobyMac\, Phil Wickham and more. Join CAIN thi
 s fall for their Live and In Worship tour\, a night designed to create sp
 ace for genuine encounter. Come as you are\, be refreshed\, and leave fil
 led in the presence of God. Through songs that speak life and moments of 
 intentional worship\, this evening invites you into something both uplift
 ing and deeply restoring with special guests each weekend of tour! Specia
 l Guest for Wheeling: Lizzie Morgan Special guest Lizzie Morgan joins CAI
 N for an unforgettable night of worship and music! Raised just outside Na
 shville\, Lizzie’s powerful vocals and heart for worship have led her t
 o perform with artists like Lauren Daigle\, Maverick City Music\, and Red
  Worship. Her debut album\, Not My Will\, blends timeless worship influen
 ces with a fresh\, modern sound that’s inspiring audiences everywhere. 
 Don’t miss the chance to experience Lizzie Morgan live before CAIN take
 s the stage!\nSchedule note: One Day Only\nCategories: Capitol Theatre\, 
 Music\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com/events/cain-live-and-in-worship-w-
 lizzie-morgan/
LOCATION:Capitol Theatre\, 1015 Main Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/cain-live-and-in-worship-w-lizzie-morg
 an/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
