UID:5cfb75e13ecdd83e2eddd22444a999e0@wheeling-events
DTSTAMP:20260727T132255Z
SUMMARY:Ohio County Master Gardeners Monthly Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T203000
DESCRIPTION:The speakers at the July 14 meeting of the Ohio County Master
  Gardeners will be Linda Dunlap and Kathie Roth\, Master Gardners and mem
 bers of the Herb Society. They will be talking about the different types 
 of herb gardens and the different uses of herbs. The meeting will be held
  6:30\, at Vance Memorial Church\, 905 National Road. The Herb Society me
 ets the first Wednesday of the month at the Ohio County Library. Each mon
 th there is a speaker who will discuss herbs or other plants. After the s
 peaker\, the monthly business meeting is held. The group also takes field
  trips. The object of the group is to share the knowledge of herbs and le
 arn from each other. New members are welcome. For more information contac
 t Kathie Roth\, kathieroth@comcast.net For more information regarding the
  Master Gardener Program\, contact the Ohio County Extension Office by em
 ailing OhioCountyExtension@mail.wvu.edu or calling 304-234-3673. https://
 extension.wvu.edu/lawn-gardening-pests/master-gardener-program The Master
  Gardeners meet monthly on the second Tuesday\, 6:30 at Vance Memorial Pr
 esbyterian Church.\nSchedule note: Every Second Tuesday\nCategories: Agri
 cultural\, Educational\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com/events/ohio-count
 y-master-gardeners-monthly-meeting/
LOCATION:Vance Memorial Presbyterian Church\, 905 National Road\, Wheelin
 g\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/ohio-county-master-gardeners-monthly-m
 eeting/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
