DTSTAMP:20260727T132255Z
SUMMARY:Wheeling Symphony Orchestra: "Bernstein In Story & Song"
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T213000
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate one of the most prolific American composers and con
 ductors\, Leonard Bernstein\, with this musical tribute featuring two exe
 mplary talents: Bernstein’s own daughter\, writer and storyteller Jamie
  Bernstein\, and powerhouse vocalist Morgan James\, in her third appearan
 ce with the WSO. From West Side Story to Candide\, enjoy this examination
  of the life and work of one of the most important figures in American or
 chestral history\, perfectly timed to celebrate America 250.\nSchedule no
 te: One Day Only\nCategories: Capitol Theatre\, Music\nSource: https://wh
 eelingcvb.com/events/wheeling-symphony-orchestra-bernstein-in-story-song/
LOCATION:Capitol Theatre\, 1015 Main Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/wheeling-symphony-orchestra-bernstein-
 in-story-song/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
