UID:4212bc9979819568a0d601f741f4b776@wheeling-events
DTSTAMP:20260727T132255Z
SUMMARY:Wheeling Symphony Orchestra: Classical Mystery Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270522T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270522T160000
DESCRIPTION:What if The Beatles had a chance to perform live in concert w
 ith a full symphony orchestra? Classical Mystery Tour brings this musical
  dream to life! The four musicians in Classical Mystery Tour not only loo
 k and sound just like The Beatles\, they are also renowned for their stun
 ningly authentic renditions of the band’s iconic hits. From “Yesterda
 y” and “A Day in the Life” to “All You Need is Love” and “Hey
  Jude\,” Classical Mystery Tour recreates the songs exactly as original
 ly recorded\, backed by the talented musicians of the Wheeling Symphony O
 rchestra. Experience this two-hour concert\, featuring timeless Beatles c
 lassics\, four costume changes\, and an unforgettable journey through the
  era and spirit of the band that changed the world.\nSchedule note: One D
 ay Only\nCategories: Capitol Theatre\, Music\nSource: https://wheelingcvb
 .com/events/wheeling-symphony-orchestra-classical-mystery-tour/
LOCATION:Capitol Theatre\, 1015 Main Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
